\begin_layout Description
\begin_inset CommandInset ref
LatexCommand ref
reference "exc:cubicSplines"

\end_inset

: Karena diberikan tiga titik, splin tersebut terdiri atas dua bagian kubik.
 Setiap bagian kubik memiliki 4 koefisien, sehingga kita perlu menyusun sistem
 8 persamaan dengan 8 peubah tak diketahui.
 Splin 
\begin_inset Formula $S$
\end_inset

 berbentuk
\begin_inset Formula 
\[
S(x)=\begin{cases}
S_{1}(x)=a_{1}+b_{1}(x-1)+c_{1}(x-1)^{2}+d_{1}(x-1)^{3}, & x\in[0,1]\\
S_{2}(x)=a_{2}+b_{2}(x-2)+c_{2}(x-2)^{2}+d_{2}(x-2)^{3}, & x\in[1,2]
\end{cases}.
\]

\end_inset

Kedelapan persamaan berasal dari tiga kelompok syarat bagi setiap splin kubik
 bebas.
\begin_inset Newline newline
\end_inset

Interpolasi:
\begin_inset Separator latexpar
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_deeper
\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{1}(0)=-9\Rightarrow a_{1}-b_{1}+c_{1}-d_{1}=-9$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{1}(1)=-13\Rightarrow a_{1}=-13$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{2}(1)=-13\Rightarrow a_{2}-b_{2}+c_{2}-d_{2}=-13$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{2}(2)=-29\Rightarrow a_{2}=-29$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Kecocokan turunan:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{1}'(1)=S_{2}'(1)\Rightarrow b_{1}=b_{2}-2c_{2}+3d_{2}$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{1}''(1)=S_{2}''(1)\Rightarrow2c_{1}=2c_{2}-6d_{2}$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
Syarat titik ujung:
\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{1}''(0)=0\Rightarrow2c_{1}-6d_{1}=0$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\begin_layout Itemize
\begin_inset Formula $S_{2}''(2)=0\Rightarrow2c_{2}=0$
\end_inset


\end_layout

\end_deeper
