LatexCommand ref
reference "exc:ode-taylor-21"

\end_inset

c: Sistem yang kita selesaikan adalah 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\dot{u} & = & g(\sin\alpha-\mu\cos\alpha)\\
\dot{s} & = & u
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

dengan kondisi awal 
\begin_inset Formula $s(0)=0$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\dot{s}(0)=0$
\end_inset

 dan nilai parameter 
\begin_inset Formula $g=32.2$
\end_inset

 ft/s
\begin_inset Formula $^{2}$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\mu=.21$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\alpha=.25$
\end_inset

 rad.
 Konversi satuan tidak diperlukan.
 Kita memasukkan nilai parameter ke dalam sistem untuk memperoleh masalah nilai awal
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\dot{u} & = & 1.41462169238826\\
\dot{s} & = & u\\
u_{0} & = & \dot{s}(0)=0\\
s_{0} & = & s(0)=0
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Menerapkan metode Euler pada sistem ini berarti mengiterasikan
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
u_{n+1} & = & u_{n}+h\dot{u}(u_{n},s_{n})=u_{n}+0.25(1.41462169238826)\\
s_{n+1} & = & s_{n}+h\dot{s}(u_{n},s_{n})=s_{n}+0.25u_{n}\\
t_{n+1} & = & t_{n}+h
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Khususnya,
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
u_{1} & = & u_{0}+0.25\dot{u}(u_{0},s_{0})\\
 & = & 0+0.25(1.41462169238826)\approx0.353655423097065\\
s_{1} & = & s_{0}+0.25u_{0}\\
 & = & 0+0.25(0)=0\\
t_{1} & = & t_{0}+0.25=.25
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

dan
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
u_{2} & = & u_{1}+0.25\dot{u}(u_{1},s_{1})\\
 & \approx & 0.3536+0.25(1.414)\approx0.7073108461941298\\
s_{2} & = & s_{1}+0.25u_{1}\\
 & \approx & 0+0.25(0.3536)\approx0.08841385577426622\\
t_{1} & = & t_{0}+0.25=.5
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Oleh karena itu, 
\begin_inset Formula $s(0.5)\approx0.08841385577426622$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

