f: Sistem yang kita selesaikan adalah 
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\dot{u} & = & \frac{F_{applied}}{m}(\cos\beta+\mu\sin\beta)-\mu g\\
\dot{s} & = & u
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

dengan kondisi awal 
\begin_inset Formula $s(0)=0$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\dot{s}(0)=.03$
\end_inset

 dan nilai parameter 
\begin_inset Formula $g=9.81$
\end_inset

 m/s
\begin_inset Formula $^{2}$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\mu=.15$
\end_inset

, 
\begin_inset Formula $\beta=\frac{\pi}{10}$
\end_inset

 rad, 
\begin_inset Formula $m=35$
\end_inset

 kg, dan 
\begin_inset Formula $F_{applied}=75$
\end_inset

 N.
 Konversi satuan tidak diperlukan.
 Kita memasukkan nilai parameter ke dalam sistem untuk memperoleh masalah nilai awal
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
\dot{u} & = & \frac{75}{35}\left(\cos\left(\frac{\pi}{10}\right)+.15\sin\left(\frac{\pi}{10}\right)\right)-.15(9.81)\approx0.6658051402529905\\
\dot{s} & = & u\\
u_{0} & = & \dot{s}(0)=.03\\
s_{0} & = & s(0)=0
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Menerapkan metode Euler pada sistem ini berarti mengiterasikan
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
u_{n+1} & = & u_{n}+h\dot{u}(u_{n},s_{n})=u_{n}+0.25(0.6658051402529905)\\
s_{n+1} & = & s_{n}+h\dot{s}(u_{n},s_{n})=s_{n}+0.25u_{n}\\
t_{n+1} & = & t_{n}+h
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Khususnya,
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
u_{1} & = & u_{0}+0.25\dot{u}(u_{0},s_{0})\\
 & = & .03+0.25(0.6658051402529905)\approx0.1964512850632476\\
s_{1} & = & s_{0}+0.25u_{0}\\
 & = & 0+0.25(.03)=0.0075\\
t_{1} & = & t_{0}+0.25=.25
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

dan
\begin_inset Formula 
\begin{eqnarray*}
u_{2} & = & u_{1}+0.25\dot{u}(u_{1},s_{1})\\
 & \approx & 0.1964+0.25(0.6658)\approx0.3629025701264953\\
s_{2} & = & s_{1}+0.25u_{1}\\
 & \approx & 0.0075+0.25(0.1964)\approx0.05661282126581191\\
t_{1} & = & t_{0}+0.25=.5
\end{eqnarray*}

\end_inset

Oleh karena itu, 
\begin_inset Formula $s(0.5)\approx0.05661282126581191$
\end_inset

.
\end_layout

